cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use NNDR, cite the accompanying manuscript and the exact software release or commit."
title: "NNDR — Non-Normal Directional Response inference toolkit"
abstract: >-
  A scientific Python toolkit for inferring non-normal amplification geometry
  from multivariate time series or known discrete operators. Includes local
  operator estimation, two-dimensional response-plane extraction, distinct
  variance-response and one-step amplification ratios, directional diagnostics,
  and model adequacy and statistical controls.
type: software
